<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,300 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,300 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,300 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 28	 November 27</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,300		15,250</p>
<p> Volume traded		    $1.915 million    $3.697 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
